Z||000002||grinthock||08-25-2001||07:55 AM||||The RECALLS are car specific at all Data the service bulletins are NOT.  If you have the equipment in your car, then the service bulletin MAY or MAY NOT apply to you.  The reason that the rear belt recall came up is probably because we use the same belts or buckles, therefore when the bulletin goes out to those cars with that belt, we got it.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://grinthock.2y.net/pics/87gt/S_P000386.JPG">   <P>Home page: <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroworld.com</A> Home  of the fiero voting booth!<BR>Owner of 85 GT<BR>87 GT Silver<BR>1995 Ford Escort Wagoon POS||||reg||1
